  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "There is an issue with avatars that disable the \"Force Locomotion for 6pt Tracking\" option in the SDK. The Dynamic bones spazz out and react as if they are moving at 100x or more of the speed that they should be, and the only way to fix this is to turn the option back on, or to jump. It also sometimes affects the location of floor colliders. For reference. my avatars have all the dynamic bones under an object in the armature/root.",
